node_modules/
dist/
*.tgz

# Fixture packages under src/generator/test-fixtures/**/node_modules are hand-written stand-ins for
# real dependencies, not installed ones. They must be tracked: the emitter resolves a declaration
# under node_modules to the BARE package specifier, and reproducing that (a name declared in a
# subpath being imported from the package root) is the point of the alias-import-closure fixture.
!src/generator/test-fixtures/**/node_modules/
!src/generator/test-fixtures/**/node_modules/**

# Staleness marker: a failing `ioc generate` records that the artifacts on disk are the last
# SUCCESSFUL write. Local, timestamped tooling state — harmless if committed (CI reading one is
# working as intended: the tree genuinely has a failing generation), but there is nothing to share.
**/.ioc-generation-state.json
